### Java/Spring Boot 模块 ###
# 编译输出
**/target/
**/build/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

# Maven/Gradle
.mvn/
mvnw*
gradle/
gradlew
gradlew.bat
!gradle-wrapper.jar
**/pom.xml.asc
**/pom.xml.releaseBackup
**/release.properties
**/dependency-reduced-pom.xml
.gradle/
!**/gradlew
!**/gradlew.bat

# 应用配置
**/application*.properties
#**/application*.yml
**/application*.yaml
**/banner.txt

# 数据库和内存文件
**/*.db
**/*.h2.db
**/hs_err_pid*

# DevTools
**/spring-boot-devtools-*.jar

# 测试报告
**/surefire-reports/
**/failsafe-reports/
**/test-results/

# 打包文件
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# 日志目录
**/logs/

